<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-112-C habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.450953" lon="-120.981971"><name>SC26-112-C</name><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 51/100; not catch probability. Center 44 ft; nearby 40–55 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Subtle local relief in the rendered grid; primarily a mapped-bottom investigation option. Near a source-coverage edge; checked 100 m circle is complete. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-088</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.45241453211508" lon="-120.98044703943798"/><trkpt lat="35.451792965530736" lon="-120.98101344423654"/><trkpt lat="35.45189044639181" lon="-120.98145170324119"/><trkpt lat="35.45162379574647" lon="-120.98167871187859"/><trkpt lat="35.45171943262179" lon="-120.98200684336605"/><trkpt lat="35.451539209442174" lon="-120.98201134471591"/><trkpt lat="35.45146934936992" lon="-120.98322499472772"/><trkpt lat="35.451747045593336" lon="-120.9836587573907"/><trkpt lat="35.45166613318736" lon="-120.98421164412554"/><trkpt lat="35.45185003563912" lon="-120.98442740337872"/><trkpt lat="35.451397637581394" lon="-120.98432851598896"/><trkpt lat="35.45140315558562" lon="-120.98465889777158"/><trkpt lat="35.45113282035788" lon="-120.98466564083284"/><trkpt lat="35.45112546289119" lon="-120.98422513328073"/><trkpt lat="35.451395798045894" lon="-120.984218